<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">- Alago Bible Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">1 Okorenti</para>
  <para style="toc1">Okpa ko Obulus kikyikyo da ase ko Okorenti</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 oKorotiyawa</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Okr</para>
  <para style="mt2">Okpa ko Obulus kikyikyo da</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ase ko Okorenti</para>
  <para style="imt">Okwotu</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Ela kikyikyo ni Obulus ta dase ko Okorenti</char> otokpa mani ikweyi koza ni yawa gbodagye ipu ko Okristi kpo otuse wa ni wa nyiso ipu koda ko Owuso ni Obulus kwotu okpagye ko Okorenti. Ipu kishi oni Okorenti wi ikweyi ko ogya nyakwu, otutehe ko okpagye ko Oroma ni ya agbabo ka Ashiya ni. Agyo kpotu koyi loshu, ase ba showu ko odu wa, ebaboba ye ebebe nya, kweyi agbowe ko Ogbo ose gogo-gogo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ayikoko ko Oyesu ko ose abiyiwa gbela byo okoko kpo ebaboba ipu koda ko Owuso, kpo okadoda ikweyi keba kpo oyagye konya kpo oba, elayipu, ogba ko oda ko Owuso, eshi ko Omaku Sere, kpo onyiso ka amiri. Kpo mani ogipu ko sayi oyoya ni Oshu neshi ka ikweyi koka doda.</para>
  <para style="ip">Otu igweta sayi kimu weshi nyakwu dase nu, ebeni pini wela ni agye she ipu ko okpa la.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1" />3 Ela mani bwebe hin Obulus, ni ayogwu wo oyikoko ko Okristi Oyesu bwebe kimu ko Owuso ni, kpo oyene kaha ko Osostenes.<verse eid="1CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2" />Go oda ko Owuso ni yo Okorenti ni, gebe kawase kpiri ni ayuwogwu ko wase sere ko Owuso ni, ni wa kakanu dudu kpo Okristi Oyesu ni, kpa ananoho ebebenya ni ba geyagye da Adole kaha Oyesu Okristi ni, Adole wa kpaha dudu:<verse eid="1CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3" />Owuso Ada ka kpa Adole Oyesu Okristi na dala oneshi kpo omene.<verse eid="1CO 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Otunehe ipu ko Okristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4" />Nyya shotunehe do Owuso hin ishi kpiri dala ikweyi koneshi nu ni odala ipu ko Okristi Oyesu ni. <verse eid="1CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5" />Ikweyi koni ipu ko dudu kpo Okristi odala odu ipu koza kpiri, kela koka kala kpiri kpo ozagyogye kala kpiri. <verse eid="1CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6" />Oleho ko Okristi hagye loshu ipu kotu kala <verse eid="1CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7" />shini ala ka tela ko zaboneshi oyoye lo, byoni ala ba gbeyi ko bose ka Adole Oyesu Okristi ni. <verse eid="1CO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8" />Oya dala oshu gokweyi, shini ala ka gbepo lo Eno ka Adole Oyesu Okristi. <verse eid="1CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9" />Owuso shu koni ankpotuso, Owuso ni yalogwu wipu kogeyagye kpo Oyi nu Oyesu Okristi Adole ka ni.<verse eid="1CO 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akyikpo Ipu ko Oda ko Owuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10" />Bwebe koshu ka Adole ka Oyesu Okristi nyya bala kpiri, ayene hin, shini ala kyogwu kpoza ni ala ka, shini ala ka kikpo lo. Shini ala bipu kema dudu, kpo otu oye kponu kpo ogbogbo oye kponu. <verse eid="1CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11" />Ikweyi koni, ase ashishini bwipwoma ko Okloyi ka dami okwokwoshi mo, apwo gbogbo yipu kala nwashika, ayene hin. <verse eid="1CO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12" />Ozani ngbo ni yoma: Anano kala ba koje gogo gogo. Ashe kamo, &lt;&lt;Nyya gboso Obulus; ashishini mo, nyya gboso Apolos; ashishini mo, nyya gboso Okefas; ashishini mo, nyya gboso Okristi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13" />Ayo Okristi yi kikpo la? Obulus pini ayo poshi ikweyi kala la? Ayala obatisima kpiye ko Obulus la? <verse eid="1CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14" />Nshotunehe do Owuso ni nyya sheshiye kala Obatisima lo, Okrispus kpo Ogayos fufuwa pini nyyuwa la. <verse eid="1CO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15" />Mani oni Ashishe ya kamo, ayala obatisima ko wino gbosun lo. <verse eid="1CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16" />Ko okwokwoshi, nyyi ipwoma ki Istifana; itikpi ko mani, ngye kwe nki yashe obatisima kelo. <verse eid="1CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17" />Okristi tumoleho ko yose Obatisima lalo. Otumoleho ko tono koshu neshi la, ke wako tono koziyi kasuse lalo, shini ikwu ko Okristi oshi naka woyeye lo.<verse eid="1CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Okristi wo Oshu kpo Oziyi ko Owuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18" />Ikweyi ni oshu kikwu ko Okristi oshi na woyeye dase ni gebi owe; ebe kaha ni angmaha oke woshu ko Owuso. <verse eid="1CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19" />Okpa ko Owuso kamo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 1:19">&lt;&lt;Nyya yoziyi ka awinoziyi ya yishi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 1:19">kweyi nyya yogyogye kawinogyoza atonu okoka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20" />Mani oni, oji gbodagye kpa awinoziyi? Kwe oji gbodagye kpino gyokpa ko Owuso? Kwe oji gbodagye kpase ni ogyase kpiri? Owuso sayi mo oziyi kese mani wo yeye la!<verse eid="1CO 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21" />Mani oni Owuso bwebe koziyi nu yo lono dase ko gyo bwebe ko ziyi wa. Abishi koni ke Owuso ngmawase ni kyogwu ni bwebe koshu ki ikyo ni aba tono nu ni, Owuso gbo otu nu ko ngmase ni kyogwu. <verse eid="1CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22" />Ase ko Yahuda ba yimu mo ana sayi koza ki igbashi ko gyokwokwoshi kweyi ase ni ke wo Oyahuda lo ni ba tikpo ko ziyi. <verse eid="1CO 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23" />Ebe kaha ke, aba tono ko Okristi mo ayo poshi, oleho ni wepo labi ebe ka Ase ko Yahuda oki wikyo ebe kase ni wase ko Yahuda lo ni; <verse eid="1CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24" />ebe kawase ni Owuso ke yuwogwu ni, ka Ase ko Yahuda ka Ase no wase ko Yahuda lo ni, Okristi woshu ko Owuso kpo oziyi ko Owuso. <verse eid="1CO 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25" />Ikweyi koni ikyo ko Owuso ziyi sho oziyi ka asuse, kweyi oza ni le byikpiye shosha ko Owuso loshu shoshu kasuse.<verse eid="1CO 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26" />Ayene hin, ala rela koza ni ala we, ishini Owuso yala ogwu ni. Bwebe ko moma kasuse nwashika kala ziyi lo gbayi kala gboshu kyi nwashika kala agyipwoma kala lo. <verse eid="1CO 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27" />Owuso ke shawoza ni ase mamo oshoshi lo ese mani ikweyi koni ona ta awinoziyi iweyi, Owuso ikeyi koni asha awoza ni loshu lo ni ese mani shini ona ta awinoshu iweyi. <verse eid="1CO 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28" />Owuso sha awoza ni ese muwa gyiyi lo ni, awoza ni amuwa wojije lo kpiri-kpiri ni, kweyi yoko kpawa shini awoza ni ese muwa woza ni naka wojije lo, <verse eid="1CO 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29" />shini ashishe naka gwabotu obutu ko Owuso lo. <verse eid="1CO 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30" />Owuso ke yala bipu ko dudu ko kristi Oyesu la, kweyi Owuso yo Okristi shini ona woziyi ka. Bwebe nu aha gbo neshi kpo Owuso; aha wase neshi ko Owuso kpo ngmongma kaha shozalabi.<verse eid="1CO 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31" />Mani oni, byoni okpa ko Owuso ka ni, &lt;&lt;Owoni oya yimu ko gwabotu, gwabotu ipu koza ni Adole ya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2" />
  <para style="s">Oleho ikweyi ko Okristi ni ayi Poshi ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1" />Ayene hin, ishini nwebe kala, ko tono kela ko Owuso ni ayigwa dami, nkela nyakwu nyakwu kwe sayi koza gyogye hin lalo. <verse eid="1CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2" />Ikweyi koni ishini nyyo kpala ni, nkyogwu otu ko nwanyi kpo ojoji, oza ni nyya nwanyi anu lo ni wo Oyesu Okristi, otata nu wo nayo poshi ni. <verse eid="1CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3" />Mani oni ishini nwwebe kala ni, nkwiye hin shiya, kweyi ya sode kpo oshi yoya, <verse eid="1CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4" />Ishini nfala oza kweyi tono dala ni, ntela ko kela ni ase ni gyo Owuso lo ya mamo aziyi shini ana kyogwu mo oleho hin wokwokwoshi, Omaku ko Owuso ke sayi mo owo kwokwoshi bwebe ko yun yoza kigbashi ni loshu. <verse eid="1CO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5" />Shini ala ka totu so oziyi kasuse lo, ke totu so oshu ko Owuso.<verse eid="1CO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oziyi ko Owuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6" />Nke tono ko ziyi dawase ni gye ipu ko omaku. Oke wo oziyi kese mani lalo kwe oshu ni ya kpogwu kese mani, awoshu oni ba kpogwu kelo. <verse eid="1CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7" />Oziyi ni nyya tono mani woziyi ko Owuso ni teba ni la, oke teba dasuse la, ni okwobo nu shu ikweyi kigyashi ka ome oyese. <verse eid="1CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8" />Ashishe ipu kawoteyi kese mani gyoziyi mani lo. Owoni abi gye la, abi ba ya Adole kigyashi kpiri ni yi poshi lo. <verse eid="1CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9" />Kole moji, Byoni okpa ke kani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">&lt;&lt;Ozani iyi oyoye kwe akpaha oyoye po wa lo ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:9">oza ni ashishe ka wa lo yagbo dagye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">owoza kpiri ni Owuso gbo dawase ni yimu nu ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10" />Owuso ke gwanu daha bwebe ko Omaku nu. Omaku ya tikpo koza kpiri, kawoza ni teba ikweyi ko Owuso. <verse eid="1CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11" />Ikweyi koni, Omaku ka ni yipu ka pini gyoza kpiri ikweyi kananoho; mamani, Omaku ko Owuso fufunu pini gyojoji ikweyi ko Owuso la. <verse eid="1CO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12" />Aha zo Omaku kese mani lalo; aha ke nyo Omaku ni bwebe ko Owuso ni la, shini ahan gyoza kpiri ni Owuso yi daha yeye ni. <verse eid="1CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13" />Ni ole mani, Aha ba kela ni oziyi ka asuse ka ni lalo, aha ke ba koza ni Omaku ko Owuso faha ni la, aba kokwokwoshi ko Omaku dawase ni gbo Omaku ni. <verse eid="1CO 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14" />Ase ni gbo Omaku lo oya zoshi ni wa bwebe ko Omaku ko Owuso ni lo. Ko kwokwoshi ase mani ya gyikweyi wa lo, ikweyi koni ebe nu awela yeye la, koni ase ni yipu ko Omaku pini ya gyikweyi nu la.<verse eid="1CO 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15" />Ase ni ke gbo Omaku ko Owuso, kole moji, oya gege ko kepwo neshi kojoji, ashishe ke ya gege ya kepwo nu lo. <verse eid="1CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16" />Byoni okpa ko Owuso kamo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:16">&lt;&lt;Anoho gyotu ka Adole?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:16">Anoho gye ko danu ela?&gt;&gt; aha, ke, gbotu ko Okristi.<verse eid="1CO 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3" />
  <para style="s">Ayole ko Owuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1" />Ayene hin, kokwokwoshi, ngege kela kpala byawase ni gbo Omaku ni lo; nke kela kpala byawase ni wa kese mani, byayi leke ipu ko otuse ko Okristi. <verse eid="1CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2" />Ndala inyi ka ame la, wozarore loshu lalo, Ikweyi koni ala gye ko roza loshu walo. Kwikyikyeni ala gye walo. <verse eid="1CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3" />Ikweyi koni Ala tayoyo ba yoza byase ni wa kese ni. Koni ala gbifu kpokpo kpapwo gbogbo kpiyi kala ni, omani sayi mo ala wa kese mani ona lo? Ni ala ba gbosoza yoya kese ni! <verse eid="1CO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4" />Owoni ashe kala mo, &lt;&lt;Nwwa ko Obulus,&gt;&gt; ashe ke mo, &lt;&lt;Nwwa ka Apolos,&gt;&gt; Ala baya byawase ni wa kese ona lo?<verse eid="1CO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5" />Gwejeji nyya dala oka, Anoho wa Apolos? Kwe anoho wo Obulus? Awayole ko Owuso kin la, ni ala kyogwu bwebe kaha bwebe kaha ni. Ananoho kaha ya yoko na Adole danu ko ya ni la: <verse eid="1CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6" />Ami shizire, Apolos shinyawo anu, Owuso pini ke yo gye la. <verse eid="1CO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7" />Ase ni shi ni, kase ni shinyawo anu ni wojije lo, Owuso fufu nu pini woza la, anu ni yoza gye ni. <verse eid="1CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8" />Ase ni shi ni, kpase ni shinyawo anu ni ya ikweyi koje kponu la; Owuso yada ananoho wa abola byoza ni oko wa naya we ni. <verse eid="1CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9" />Ikweyi koni awa rema dudu ebe koyoko ko Owuso, ala ke weho ko Owuso. Ala kyi woda ko Owuso.<verse eid="1CO 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10" />Nyyoko kpeshi ni Owuso dami ni, nshikpo ko oda nyyo ko kpeshi hin byase ni gyishi ko moda neneshi ni, ashe hoha wa moda ikweyi nu. Ananoho na ke gbera kpabo ni oya ma ni. <verse eid="1CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11" />Ikweyi Koni Owuso kwobonu yo Oyesu Okristi fufunu pini wikpo koda ni la, ashishe ya shikpo koda oyoye kelo. <verse eid="1CO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12" />Ashishini ba yoko kpozinariya, azurupa, kwe ikyikpo ni gbakwekye ni ko moda ikweyi kikpo ko oda ni ashe ni; Ase ashishini ba ma kpo efu, kwe eko, kwe anangbla. <verse eid="1CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13" />Aba moneshi koko kananoho Eno ko wowa ko Okristi. Koni Eno oni Ola ya sayi oko kananoho; kweyi ola mani ya mo oneshi koko ka ananoho ma. <verse eid="1CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14" />Owoni oza ni ama ni yola lo, ase ni ma ni ya pyabola nu. <verse eid="1CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15" />Owoni oko wo ke yola, ishi ya yo; anu abiyinu aba ngmanu, oke ya le byase ni bose bwo ola ni shishi.<verse eid="1CO 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16" />Ala gye mala abiyikala wole ko Owuso kweyi Omaku ko Owuso yipu kala! <verse eid="1CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17" />Ase ni yo ole Owuso yishi Owuso ya yo ishi mamani. Koni ole ko Owuso wo sere, ala pi wole ni la.<verse eid="1CO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18" />Ala ka gyiyikala egya lo. Owoni ashe kala ya ma manu ziyi kpoza kese mani, ona wikyo shini ona ziyi kokwokwoshi. <verse eid="1CO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19" />Ikweyi koni oziyi kese mani wikyo ebe komoma ko Owuso la. Byoni okpa ko Owuso ka, &lt;&lt;Owuso kwa winoziyi ipu kegya wa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20" />Okpa ki kamo, &lt;&lt;Adole gye kamo ela kotu kawino ziyi wela yeye la.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21" />Ni olemani oni ashishe naka gwabotu kpoza ni asuse yani lo. Kwokwoshi ojoji wakakala la: <verse eid="1CO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22" />Obulus, Apolos kpo Obitrus; ese mani, kwo olayi kwi ikwu, kwe oza kanani kwe akohobu; kpiri wakakala la, <verse eid="1CO 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23" />mamani ala wa ko Okristi, Okristi wa ko Owuso.<verse eid="1CO 3:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4" />
  <para style="s">Ayikoko ko Okristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1" />Ni olemani oni, ala shu ko maha byayole ko Okristi, ki byawase ni ayawoza teba ko Owuso dawa abo ni. <verse eid="1CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2" />Ojiya ni aba doka mo ayole mani naya ni wa ko yokwokwoshi da Adole wa. <verse eid="1CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3" />Anani, owoni ala kwumepwo kwe akwumepwo bwebe koza yoya kese mani oya shiwo hin lo kpiri-kpiri; kokwokwoshi ami ya gege kwiyun epwo lo. <verse eid="1CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4" />Otu hin woye kponu, oni ke ya sayi mo epwo hin shoshi lalo. Adole pini ya kepwo hin la. <verse eid="1CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5" />Mani oni, ala ka kwashishe epwo ome ishi na ya lo. Gwejeji epwo koka wotiri ko gbishi ka Adole na wa ome. Oya byojoji ni ayi teba ebe dibu ni webe yoyu kweyi ya yela kotu kasuse tese. Ishi oni ananoho ya nyiye shosha nu ebe ko Owuso.<verse eid="1CO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6" />Nyya kela mani abishi kala la, Ayene hin, nka ikweyi kiyun kpa Apolos kpa me, shini ala fu bwebe kaha asepa, shini ala gyikweyi kela ni aka mo, &lt;&lt;Ala ko ono gyogye.&gt;&gt; Ala ka gwabotu kpashe kweyi tashe nye lo. <verse eid="1CO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7" />Anoho yala shase ashini? Oji ni ala gbo ni Owuso pini dala lalo? Ojiyala ba gwabotu, byoza nala gboni weshi la lo?<verse eid="1CO 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8" />Ala kwobonu gbojoji ni ala ba yimu ni wa? Ala kwobonu wolodu wa? Ala wo ose wa, koni aha we wa lo ni? Ala bi wo ose kwokwoshi, shini ahan wo ose kpala dudu. <verse eid="1CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9" />Koni nyya ma mo Owuso yaha ayikoko ko Oyesu bitikpi, byawase ni akuwepwo ko yuwa ngmo iyi ka nanoho kweyi woza ko moma dese kpiri ka ayoleho kasuse. <verse eid="1CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10" />Awikyo abishi ko Okristi, ala ke ziyi ipu ko dudu kpo Okristi! Aha loshu lo, ala ke loshu! Aha gyiyi lo, ala ake aba dala abokpa! <verse eid="1CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11" />Kwikyikyeni aba ngmemye kpigini; aha shoshiye shosha, agwaha ize, kweyi aha ba gyehe waya-waya; <verse eid="1CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12" />Aha ba yoko kotata kpabo ka. Ishini ayaha okwunu aha ba suwa aboneshi ishini adahowe, aha ba zotu; <verse eid="1CO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13" />ishini asahesa, aha kyogwu kpoko kela mene. Kwikyikyeni aha wa akya kese mani, aki weya kese mani!<verse eid="1CO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14" />Nyya tawoza mani dala, wa ko taliweyi lalo, ko pyala akpaha la ni ala wayi hin moshi ni. <verse eid="1CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15" />Kala gbawo byala okpaku igwo ipu ko Okristi, ala gbada woye kpokponu. Koni ipu ko layi kala dudu kpo Okristi Oyesu nwwada kala bwebe ko oshu neshi ni nbi wa dala ni. <verse eid="1CO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16" />Mani oni, nyya bala shini ala gbami. <verse eid="1CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17" />Ikweyi kela mani nyya to Otimoti oleho ebe kala, anu ni oyi hin moshi ni gbo kwokwoshi ipu ka Adole ni. Oya rala oyagye hin ipu ko Okristi Oyesu, ni woye kponu kpoza ni nyya fu ebebenya ipu koda ko Owuso wonyonya ni.<verse eid="1CO 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18" />Ashini kala ba zikweyi iso ikweyi koni alaba ma byo nyya wa mala kelo ni. <verse eid="1CO 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19" />Oke ya gbeji kelo nyya wa, owoni Adole kyogwu, kweyi ishi oni nyya wa gyoshu ni awo zikweyi iso mani gbo ni, woza ni aba ka ni kin lalo. <verse eid="1CO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20" />Ikweyi koni obula ko Owuso wela ko koka lalo oke wela koshu la. <verse eid="1CO 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21" />Onya ni ala yimu she? Na webe kala kpaboshi, kwe na wa ipu kimu yoya kpo Omaku mene?<verse eid="1CO 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5" />
  <para style="s">Epwo Ikweyi ke Eba Boba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1" />Anani, Ashumepwo mo ashishini kala ba beba kotata, edo koza ni awase ni gyo Owuso lo ba yalo ni: npwo mo ashe ipu kala ya myo onya ka ada nu. <verse eid="1CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2" />Ojiya ni ala ba gwabotu kpoza mani? Ala shu ko byotu nwashika, kweyi yo ongo ni yoza mani ngma shipu kema kala. <verse eid="1CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3" />Ko ni nyyebe ni kpala ipu kikpiye lo ni, nyyo kpala ipu ko omaku. Ipu kiye ka Adole nkwobonu kwase ni yoza labi mani epwo wa, byun yebeni kpala ni. <verse eid="1CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4" />Mani oni ishini ala gbayi dudu, ipu kiye ka Adole Oyesu, nyyo kpala ipu ko Omaku, kweyi oshu ka Adole kaha Oyesu yo kpala, <verse eid="1CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5" />ala yo ongo mani nabo di Ibiri shini ona yikpiye nu kozalabi yi ngmo, shini ana ngmo omaku nu Eno ka Adole.<verse eid="1CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6" />Ala shu ko gwabotu kpoza mani lo! Ala gye mo, &lt;&lt;Oyisi gbayayi ni ya yi ikyoga ya nu lalo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7" />Ala yoyisi nekye ko ozalabi ngma shini ozalabi naka yipu kala lo. Ome ala ba lema byi ikyoga pepe ni gbo oyisi lo, ko okwokwoshi ngye mo ala lema ni. Ikweyi koni akwobonu yo Okristi ni wo Oyi ko Otukpo ki Imya ko Osheyi ni yi peshi wa. <verse eid="1CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8" />Mani oni, an rimya ko Osheyi kaha, kpi ikyoga ni gbo Oyisi nekye ko ozalabi kpotu bibi ni lalo, an re kpi ikyoga ni ke gboyisi lo ni, ikyoga kotu neshi kpo okwokwoshi.<verse eid="1CO 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9" />Ipu kokpa ni nta dala ni, nka dala mala ka rema kawo beba lo. <verse eid="1CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10" />Nyya kela kase kese mani ni ba beba ki gba afu ni lalo, kwe awo yimu koza diyiwa, kwe awowi, kwe awo geyagye deka lalo. Owa koni ala ba she ese bita kpiri-kpiri. <verse eid="1CO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11" />Ozani nyya kani yoma, ase ni ya yiyinu ogwu manu wi inogboso Oyesu kweyi ke ya beba ki gbafu, ya geyagye deka, ya yase ishi, ya gwinyi kwe oya wiyi, ala ka rema nu lo. Ala ka roza kpedo kasuse mani lo kpiri-kpiri.<verse eid="1CO 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12" />Onya wakaka hin ko kepwo kase ni bese ni? Ase ni bipu koda ko Owuso ni pini ala ba kepwo wa lalo? <verse eid="1CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13" />Owuso ya kepwo kase ni bese ni. &lt;&lt;Ala yase bibi ngma shipu kala.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 5:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6" />
  <para style="s">Epwo Koka ikweyi ka Ayene ipu ko Okristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1" />Owoni ashe kala gbela kpo oyene oye ipu ko Okristi, naka bi gebe kawase ni gyo Owuso lo ni lo, abishi koni ona bi gebe kawa ase ko Owuso. <verse eid="1CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2" />Ala gye mase ko Owuso pini ba kepwo kese lalo? Mani oni, owoni ala pini ba kepwo kese la, ala ba gege ko kepwo kawela gbayi-gbayi ni ba nyiso ipu kala ni lo? <verse eid="1CO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3" />Ala gye mo aha ba wa kepwo ka ayoleho ko Owuso lo? Owoni olemani, epwo kese mani ya shahoshu ko koka lo! <verse eid="1CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4" />Mani oni, owoni ala gbedo kawela mani, ala shase ipu ko oda ko Owuso, kawase ni aba muwa wojije lo ipu koda ko Owuso ni shini ana wawo kepwo kala? <verse eid="1CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5" />Nka mani shala yiweyi la! Kokwokwoshi ashishe kponu ziyi ipu kala koni oya kepwo kawogboso ni lo? <verse eid="1CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6" />Abishi koni, oyene oye ya byo oyinanu goda ko kepwo obutu kawase ni gyo Owuso lo ni!<verse eid="1CO 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7" />Ikweyi koni ala byiyikala goda ko kepwo ni, ala kwobonu zigbo kpiri-kpiri oma. Oya shoshi she shini oshase bita na yobibi lo? Oya shoshi she shini oshase bita na ro oza oshu lo? <verse eid="1CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8" />Abishi koni, ala abiyikala ba yiyikala obibi ki ba riyikala oza oshu, kawase ni kyogwu ni.<verse eid="1CO 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9" />Ko kwokwoshi Ala gye mo Ase-bibi ba rogwu ko Obula ko Owuso lo. Ashishe naka gyalegya lo; awo beba, awo geyagye deka, awagbaza, kango ni ba beba ni, kawo beba kongo-kpongo, kwonya-kponya <verse eid="1CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10" />kawo owi, kawo gbafu, kawo gwinyi, kawo yase ishi, kawo gyasegya kpiri ba rogwu ko Obula ko Owuso lo. <verse eid="1CO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11" />Ishi ni shigbo ni ashishini kala lemani la. Ake yala na sho ozalabi, akyalatu ebe ko Owuso; ayala waseneshi ko Owuso ipu kiye ka Adole Oyesu Okristi bwebe ko Omaku ko Owuso kaha.<verse eid="1CO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoko kpi Ikpiye kala di Igyashi ko Owuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12" />Ashe ya kamo, &lt;&lt;Nyya gege ko yojoji,&gt;&gt; olemani; oza kpiri pini ke ya shoshi dawo lalo. Nyya kamo Nyya gege ko yojoji, nke ya kyogwu koni ojije ya yun ya wo oshe nu lo. <verse eid="1CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13" />Ashe hoha ya kamo, &lt;&lt;Ozarore wa kipu kweyi ipu wa ko ozarore.&gt;&gt; Olemani, Owuso ke ya yawoza epa mani ba wa kweyi. Ikpiye wa ko beba lalo, oke wa ko yoko ka Adole la, kweyi Adole wa kikpiye. <verse eid="1CO 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14" />Owuso ya Adole nyiso bwikwu, anu ki yaha ba nyiso bwikwu mamani kposhu nu. <verse eid="1CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15" />Ala gye mikpiye kala wigo kikpiye ko Okristi la. Na zigo kikpiye ko Okristi ga yi pwayi kpikpiye ka agbaza? Ogbowe lo! <verse eid="1CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16" />Ala gye mase ni yikpiye pwayi kpa agbaza owoye kponu kpanu ipu kikpiye lalo? Okpa ko Owuso ka shese mo, &lt;&lt;Asepa ba wikpiye oyekponu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17" />Aseni ke yipu ka Adole owoye kponu kpanu ipu komaku.<verse eid="1CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18" />Ala nyinya sheba boba. Ashishini kozalabi ni asuse yaya kpiri ni bese kikpiye nu la, ase ni ke yozalabi keba boba oyikpiye nu ozalabi. <verse eid="1CO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19" />Ala gye mikpiye kala woda ko Omaku ko Owuso lalo? Ni yipu kala, ni ala ze bwebe ko Owuso ni. Ala wa kiyikala lalo, ala wa ko Owuso la; <verse eid="1CO 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20" />Owuso rala rora kpakwekye. Mani oni, ala yoko kpikpiye kala digyashi ko Owuso.<verse eid="1CO 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7" />
  <para style="s">Oka doda Ikweyi ko Oyagye Ko onya Kpo oba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1" />Nabani, ikweyi koza ni yala tokpa ni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 7:1">Ongo yoza neshi ko gbonya lo. <verse eid="1CO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2" />Ikweyi koni eba boba ke shoshu ni, ongo wonyonya na gbonya nu, mamani onya wonyonya na gbobu nu. <verse eid="1CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3" />Oba na yoza ni oshu ko yoya ni, mamani onya na yoza ni oshu ko yoya ni, kpiri wa ana yiwa otusha. <verse eid="1CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4" />Ikpiye ko onya wa ka nu lalo, ikpiye nu ke wa kobu nu, mamani la ikpiye koba wakakanu lalo, oke wa konya nu la. <verse eid="1CO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5" />Ala ka wiyikala obi lo, sala kyogwu dudu ko kwiyikala kishi gbayayi shini ala ziyi kala dinarigwu tota; Itikpi koni ala ki kwikye gbayi lalo Ibiri ya malama koni ala gege ko kwiyi kala lo ni. <verse eid="1CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6" />Oza ni nka mani wo ono lalo, ami pini kala. <verse eid="1CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7" />Kokwokwoshi nbiya yimu mo ananoho kala na le byoni nwwe ni. Ananoho ke gbeshi ni Owuso danu ni, ashe gbeshi oye, ashe ke gboye hoha.<verse eid="1CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8" />Anani, nyya ka dala ni gbonya kwoba walo kpa anyokwu, oshoshi shini ana bagye fufuwa byami. <verse eid="1CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9" />Owoni ake ba gege ba kwiyiwa lo, ana gbonya kwoba, koni oshoshi kogbonya kwoba sho mehe kanya kwango.<verse eid="1CO 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10" />Awase ni ke gboba, kwo onya ni, nyya dawono mani bwebe hin lalo ke wa ka Adole; onya naka kabo kpobu nu lo. <verse eid="1CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11" />Owoni oke kabo, owotiri koni oya yagye fufunu kwe ona kwikye gebe kobu nu. Kweyi oba naka kabo kponya nu lo.<verse eid="1CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12" />Nyya ka dase ashini mo (Ami, abiyun pini kala, Adole lalo) owoni oyene oye gbonya ni gyo Owuso lo ni kweyi anonya gbimu ko yagye kpanu, onaka kabo kpanu lo. <verse eid="1CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13" />Mamani owoni onya oye gboba ni gyo Owuso lo ni kweyi anobu nu gbimu ko yagye kpanu, onaka kabo kpanu lo. <verse eid="1CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14" />Ikweyi koni Owuso ya zo oba ni gyo Owuso lo ni bwebe ko dudu nu kponya nu ni gyo Owuso ni, mamani Owuso ya zo onya ni gyo Owuso lo ni bwebe ko dudu kpo obu ni kpo gyo Owuso ni. Owoni olema lo, ayi wa ba wayi ni gyo Owuso lo, ni oke lemani, ayi wa ba wayi neshi ebe ko Owuso.<verse eid="1CO 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15" />Owoni ase ni ke gyo Owuso lo ni yimu koganu, ona ganu. Ipu ko mani Ojije yo ongo kwonya ni gyo Owuso ni, gbo ipu kela mani lo. Owuso yahogwu ko yagye ipu komene la. <verse eid="1CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16" />Onya, oyamoji ya gye, kwawo pi ya ngmo obu wo la? Kwe, Oba, oyamoji ya gye, kwawo pi ya ngmo onya wo la<verse eid="1CO 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yagye Byoni Owuso Yogwu ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17" />Ananoho kala na yagye ipu keshi ni Adole danu ni, kyiyo byoni oyo ome Owuso yuwogwu ni. Omani pi wono ni nfu oda ko Owuso kpiri ni la. <verse eid="1CO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18" />Owo ni Ongo ni shofu pwogwu ko Owuso, naka takirikwu ko kwikye wofu afafu lo; ase ni ke wofu afafu ni pwogwu ko Owuso, ona ka takirikwu ko shofu lo. <verse eid="1CO 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19" />Ase ni shofu kwe Ase ni wofu afafu owojije lo; oza ni shoshi she ni ko ono ko Owuso. <verse eid="1CO 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20" />Ananoho na yagye byoni oyo ome opwogwu ko Owuso ni. <verse eid="1CO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21" />Owo oshe ome Owuso yogwu la? Ka byotu lo; owoni oke ya gbowe ko ngmiyo sheshe moma, ngmiyo. <verse eid="1CO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22" />Ikweyi koni ase ni wo oshe ome opwogwu ka Adole owase ni Adole ngmanu ni; mamani, aseni wo oshe lo ome opwogwu ka Adole owo oshe ko Okristi. <verse eid="1CO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23" />Owuso rala rora kpakwekye la; mani oni ala ka wo oshe kasuse lo. <verse eid="1CO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24" />Ayene hin, ananoho na yagye nu byoni owe ome opwogwu ni Owuso, kweyi na rema ko Owuso.<verse eid="1CO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Okadoda ikweyi kawase ni gbo onya kpo oba lo kpa Anyokwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25" />Anani, ela kawi isongo kpawi isonya: Ngbono oye bwebe ka Adole ko dala lo, nke ya ka koni ala kyogwu kpa ami bwebe kiyinyinyi ka Adole ni. <verse eid="1CO 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26" />Ikweyi ko owe kishi mani, nma mo oya shoshi shini ala bagye kala mani. <verse eid="1CO 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27" />Awo ni ogbonya ka kabo kpa wa lo. Owoni oke gbonya kwe oba lo, ka gbo lo. <verse eid="1CO 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28" />Owoni gbonya, oyozalabi lalo; owoni isonya gboba, oyozalabi lalo. Awase ni gbo onya kwo oba ni gbowe nwashika ipu koyagye wa, ami ke ya yimu shini ala ka mowe mani lo.<verse eid="1CO 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29" />Ozani nyya ka ni yoma, Ayene hin, ishi shishini nwashika kelo, bwanani awase ni gba anya ni na bagye bya gba anya lo ni; <verse eid="1CO 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30" />awase ni ba kyegba ni, na ya byaba kyegba lo; awase ni ba yeye ni ana ya byaba shotunehe lo; awase ni ba riyo ni na ya byoza nara ni wakakawa lalo ni; <verse eid="1CO 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31" />awase ni ba yotu soza kese mani, ana gye mo odu kese mani wo wojije lo. Ikweyi koni ese mani byoni aba ma mani, ya gbeji kelo.<verse eid="1CO 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32" />Nyya yimu shini ojije naka shiwo kala lo. Ongo ni gbo onya lo, oza ni ya shiwo nu ni na woko ka Adole, ikweyi koni oya takirikwu ko yotu ka Adole nasha. <verse eid="1CO 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33" />Ase ni gbo onya ni, otu nu ke yoza kese mani, koyo zani otu konya nu yasha ni; <verse eid="1CO 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34" />Mani oni otu nu ya kepa. Onya ni gboba lo kwe isonya ke ya yotu nu do oko ka Adole, ikweyi koni oya yimu ko yoko ka Adole ipu kikpiye kpo Omaku sere; Onya ni ke gboba ni, otu nu yoza kese mani, ikweyi koni oya yimu ko sho obunu otu. <verse eid="1CO 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35" />Nyya kela mani ikweyi koni nyya yimu ko talabo la. Nyya yimu ko walobi lalo. Abishi koni, nyya yimu shini ala yoza owe neneshi, shini ala ziyikala do oko ka Adole kpiri-kpiri gbo kwikpiye lo.<verse eid="1CO 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36" />Owoni ongo oye ya ma manu yi isonya ni ayi ko ni oza neshi lo koni omanu ya gbonya lo ni, kweyi oma mo oshu koni aba doka kiyiwa ikweyi koni ogege kwiyinu lo ni, ana doka kiyiwa, byoni oya yimu ni. Owo ozalabi lalo. <verse eid="1CO 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37" />Ongo ni ke gbo ipu ko otu nu manu ya gbonya lo, owoni ashe kwo koshu ko ya mani lalo, kweyi owoni oya gege ko kwiyinu kpiri-kpiri, kweyi kwobonu gboza ko yoya ipu ko otu nu, oya gyogye owoni odoka kisonya oni lo. <verse eid="1CO 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38" />Mani oni, aseni gbonya oyoza neshi, ase ni ke gbonya lo anu pini yoneshi she la. <verse eid="1CO 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39" />Onya ni gboba oyabo kiyi nu lo owoni Obu nu yiyi; owoni obunu ke gekwu, oya gege ya gboba ni shotu ni, ona ke wase ni ya gboso Oyesu ni kin. <verse eid="1CO 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40" />Onya mani ke ya shotunehe she, owoni oyagye fufunu. Omani wo okoka hin la, nki ma mo ngbo Omaku ko Owuso mamani.<verse eid="1CO 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8" />
  <para style="s">Ozarore ni Ayipeka ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1" />Anani, ikweyi koza ni ala ta dami ikweyi kozarore ni ayipeka ni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 8:1">Agye mo owo kwokwoshi, mo kpiri ka gbogyogye byoni akamo, &lt;&lt;Ozagyogye ya yase ya zikweyi iso, imu yoya ke ya yase ya gye giso.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2" />Ase ni ya ma manu gyoza ni gye febe ni oshu ko gye funi walo. <verse eid="1CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3" />Aseni ke ya yimu ko Owuso ni, Owuso gyo.<verse eid="1CO 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4" />Mani oni, ela ko roza ni ayi peka ni: Aha gye mo eka wojije lo, aha gye mo Owuso woye kponu kin la. <verse eid="1CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5" />Koni amo awowuso baba iso kwo okpagye koni awowuso kpa awadole mani nwashika ni, <verse eid="1CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6" />ebe kaha Owuso woye kponu la, anu pini wa Ada, ni yojoji ni; kweyi aha ba geyagye danu; Adole woye kpokponu kin la, Oyesu Okristi, anu ni ayojoji bwebe nu, kweyi aha gbo olayi bwebe nu.<verse eid="1CO 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7" />Ase kpiri pini ke gyo okwokwoshi mani lalo. Ashishini kase ba geyagye deka kwikyikyeni owoni aroza mani aba ma byo ozarore ni are mani wa keka la; kweyi otu wa loshu lo, aba mamo ozarore ni ya yuwa yuwa yishi obutu ko Owuso. <verse eid="1CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8" />Ozarore ke ya kye ema kaha tu kpo Owuso lo; owoni aha re lo, oya yaha ojije lo, owoni aha re, oya daha ojije lo.<verse eid="1CO 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9" />Ala ke gbera, shini iyawu kala ko yoza ni shalotu ni naka yawase ni sha ni na gbo ipu ko ozalabi lo. <verse eid="1CO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10" />Ikweyi koni owoni ase ni sha ni mala ni bamo ala gbogyogye ni ba roza ipu kole keka, oya danoshu ko roza ni ayipeka ni lo? <verse eid="1CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11" />Mani oni ase ni sha mani, oyene kala ni Okristi gekwu ikweyi nu ni, ya yishi bwebe kogyogye kala! <verse eid="1CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12" />Bwebe koni ala ba yo Okristi Ozalabi bwebe ko ya ayene kala ni hagye loshu lo ni ozalabi, koni ala yo otu wa ofo ni.<verse eid="1CO 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13" />Mani oni, owoni oza ni nyya ha ni ya yo oyene hin ya yo ozalabi, nyya hoza kelo, shini naka yo oyene hin na gbo lo.<verse eid="1CO 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9" />
  <para style="s">Oshu Kpo Oko ka Ayikoko ko Oyesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1" />Nyya abo ki iyun lalo? Nwwo oyikoko ko Oyesu lalo? Nmo Oyesu Adole kaha lo? Ala wa awogboso ikweyi koko hin ni nyya da Adole ni lalo? <verse eid="1CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2" />Owoni nwwo oyikoko ko Oyesu ebe kase ashini lo, ogbawashu lo nwwe ebe kala! Ikweyi koni olayi kala rema dudu kpa Adole ala abiyikala wolobene ko oyikoko ko Oyesu ni nwwe ni.<verse eid="1CO 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3" />Owoni ase ba kwumepwo, owe ni nyya nyepwo ki iyun ni yoma. <verse eid="1CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4" />Ngboshu koni ala ba damo ozarore kwi inyi ko gwogwa ko oko hin lo? <verse eid="1CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5" />Ngboshu ko gbo onya ipu ka awogboso shini na bi giyawu kpanu byoni ayikoko ko Oyesu ashini kpa ayene ka Adole kpo Obitrus ya ni lo? <verse eid="1CO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6" />Kwe ami kpo Obarnabas kin pi shu ko yoko ome shini ahan pyoza ko yagye kaha la?<verse eid="1CO 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7" />Anoho ya yo oko ka adakare kweyi ya siyinu ore? Anoho ya sheho kweyi ya hogwogwa kefu keho nu lo? Anoho ya gwo obize kweyi ya gwinyi kame wa lo? <verse eid="1CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8" />Nyya hagye ikweyi kawoza ni ba gbodagye kurutu mani lo, ikweyi koni ngye mo Ono ko oje kponu. <verse eid="1CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9" />Aha maka ipu ko Ono ko Omusa mo, &lt;&lt;Ka yo okwunu ke ena gbo ishini oya kyizire ni lo.&gt;&gt; Anani, ela ka awena mani pini shiwo ko Owuso la? <verse eid="1CO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10" />Okela mani ikweyi kaha lalo? Ko kwokwoshi atoza mani ikweyi kaha la. Ase ni tizire kpase ni kyizire ni aya mani koni ayiyi tagye ko pyi ingbo ki izire la. <verse eid="1CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11" />Aha ti izire ko Omaku ipu kala. Oya shoshu koni aba kyi izire ki ikpiye ebe kala ni? <verse eid="1CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12" />Owoni ashishini kase gboshu ko doka koza abo kala, ala mamo agboshu shuwa lo?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 9:12">Aha ke yoko kposhu mani lo. Abishi koni, aha zotu kpo ojoji kpiri shini ojije naka wobi koshu neshi ko Okristi lo. <verse eid="1CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13" />Ko kwokwoshi ala gye mase ni ba yoko ipu kole ko Owuso ni ba pyo ozarore wa bwipu kole ko Owuso, kweyi ase ni ba peshi okpe ni ba pyozarore wa bwebe koza ni ayipa ni la. <verse eid="1CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14" />Mamani, Adole kamo ase ni ba tono ko oshu neshi ni na pyozarore wa bwebe koshu neshi ni na pyoza ko yagye wa bwebe ko oshu neshi.<verse eid="1CO 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15" />Ami ke doka shala dami ojije lo, kwe tawoza mani shini na nyoza ni wakakahin ni lalo. Oya shashi shini na gekwu, koni ashe ya wumobi ko gwabotu mani ni! <verse eid="1CO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16" />Ngboshu ko gwabotu lo ikweyi koni nyya tono koshu neshi ni. Gwejeji, Owuso pini yun mo na tono koshu neshi la. Ebi na tun owoni ntela ko tono koshu neshi! <verse eid="1CO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17" />Owoni nyyo oko hin kpotu oye kponu, nyya yi iyitagye ko pyabola; owoni nke ya kpotu oye kponu lo, nyya yo oko ni Owuso mo na ya ni kin la. <verse eid="1CO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18" />Oji wa abola hin ome? Abola hin wako tono ko Oshu Neshi ko yeye, nyya nya abola oyoye ebe ko tono koshu neshi lo.<verse eid="1CO 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19" />Nwwo oshe lalo, nke wo oshe kashishe lo; nziyun shina wo oshe kananoho, shini na byase nwashika webe nu. <verse eid="1CO 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20" />Ishini nyya yoko kpase ko Oyahuda ni ngboso odu kase ko Oyahuda shini na byuwa webe nu. Koni nyya geyagye do Ono ko Omusa lo ni, nyya byase ni ya geyagye do ono ko Omusa, shini na yuwa na kyogwu kpa mi. <verse eid="1CO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21" />Mamani, ishini nyya yoko kpawase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni, nyya byo nwwase ko Oyahuda lo, shini na pya awase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni. Omani ya wumobi ko geyagye do Ono ko Owuso lo; ko kwokwoshi nyyipu ko ono ko Okristi. <verse eid="1CO 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22" />Ebe kawase ni loshu ipu kotuse lo ni, nyya byase ni loshu ipu kotuse lo ni, shini ana kyogwu kpa mi. Mani oni nwwoza kpiri dase kpiri, shini na ngmashini wa bwowe wonyonya ni nyya gege ni.<verse eid="1CO 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23" />Nyyoza mani kpiri ela ko oshu neshi, shini na pyaboneshi nu.<verse eid="1CO 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24" />Ko kwokwoshi Ala gye ma awonyinya nwashika ba myenya, ashe oye kpokponu pini ke ya pya abola la. Mani oni ala nyinya, owe ni ala ba pyabola ni.<verse eid="1CO 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25" />Awomyenya kpiri owotiri ko gboso ono kenya nyonye, Aba ya mani ko pyo otu ni ya gbeji lo ni; aha ke ba ya ko pyo otu ni ya rese ko gbogbo-gbogbo ni. <verse eid="1CO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26" />Mani oni, nyya nyinya waya waya lo; nyya nonu byase ni ya gwo owu ni lo. <verse eid="1CO 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27" />Nyya gwi ikpiye hin kweyi yo woshe hin, shini itikpi ni ntono dase ashini ni, ana ka wa yun ngma tese lo.<verse eid="1CO 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10" />
  <para style="s">Akpaha Pyopyi Ikweyi ko Geyagye de Eka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1" />Awa ayene hin, nyya yimu shala ra, oza ni tawo kyikyi ka ni gboso Omusa ni. Akamo akpa ngmawa kweyi kpiri wa sheyi ki ishu nowa, ojije tawa lo. <verse eid="1CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2" />Ayuwo obatisma ipu ka akpa kpi ishu kweyi kpiri wa wawo gboso Omusa. <verse eid="1CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3" />Kpiri wa hikyoga ko Omaku oyekponu ni wa bwebe ko Owuso bwebe koshu nu ni <verse eid="1CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4" />kweyi agwinyi ko Omaku oyekponu ni bwebe ko Owuso. Agwinyi bwipu ko okpo ni gakpa wa ni; okpo oni wo Okristi abiyinu. <verse eid="1CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5" />Ipu kishi oni Owuso ke shotunehe kpase nwashika ipu wa lo. Mani oni okwu wa shonu shonu ipu kimweshi.<verse eid="1CO 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6" />Anani, kpiri kawoza mani gbodagye shini ona woza fofu daha, shini aha anka yimu koza labi byoni awa ya ni lo. <verse eid="1CO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7" />Kweyi anka geyagye deka, byoni ashishini wa ya ni lo. Byoni okpa ko Owuso kamo, &lt;&lt;Ase mani bagye ba roza ba gwinyi ba beba kpiyiwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8" />Anka beba byoni ashishini wa ya ni lo ipu ke eno oye kponu ase okpakwu awepa ayeta gbo okpagye kweyi gekwu kpiri. <verse eid="1CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9" />Anka mo Owuso ma lo, byoni ashishini kase ya ni, egwa yuwa ngmo kpiri. <verse eid="1CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10" />Anka kakyose lo, byoni ashishini wa ya ni kweyi oyoleho kikwu yuwa ngmo.<verse eid="1CO 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11" />Awoza mani kpiri gbodagye kpawa shini ase ashini na ma, kweyi ayi tota ko pyaha akpaha. Koni abishi ni okweyi kese ya gbeji kelo ni.<verse eid="1CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12" />Mani oni, owoni ala ma mala hagye loshu, ala gbera shini ala ka gbo lo.<verse eid="1CO 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13" />Kpiri kedo komama ni tala ni, woye kponu kpoza ni ya tashishini ni. Owuso ke ya byo okoyi nu, anu ya shomama bita na shaloshu lo, Ishini aba malama, oya dala oshu ko hagye loshu, kpowe ni ala ba bose ipu ko mama ni.<verse eid="1CO 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14" />Mani oni, ayene hin moshi, ala sho geyagye daweka bita. <verse eid="1CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15" />Nyya kela dala byawase ni gyoza koyoya ni; ala shepwo abiyikala ikweyi koza ni nka mani. <verse eid="1CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16" />Abwa ni aba gwinyi kpanu ebe ko Ozarore ka Adole, ni aba shotunehe do Owuso ikweyi nu ni, ishini aha gwinyi bwipu nu, aha gbingbo ipu ko oyi ko Okristi dudu. Kweyi ikyoga ni aba foha ni, ishini aha ha, aha gbingbo ipu kikpiye ko Okristi.<verse eid="1CO 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17" />Ikweyi koni ikyoga woye kpokponu, koni anwashika ni, kpiri kaha, wikpiye oyekponu la, kweyi kpiri kaha ikyoga oyekponu pini aba ha la.<verse eid="1CO 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18" />Rela kase ki Izrayila; Awase ni ba roza ni ayi peshi ni ba re dudu ikweyi ko okpe koko ko Owuso. <verse eid="1CO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19" />Mani oni nyya kamo eka kwe ozarore ni ayipeka ni gboko ko oje la? <verse eid="1CO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20" />Aayi! Oza ni nyya ka ni yoma oza ni ayipo okpe ke eka wako owu bibi oke wako Owuso lalo. Ni olemani oni nyya yimu shini ala ka rema dudu kpo owu bibi lo. <verse eid="1CO 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21" />Ala ba gwinyi bwa abwa ka Adole kweyi ki gwa bwa abwa ko owu bibi lo. Ala ba re ikweyi ko oda ko Owuso kweyi ki re ikweyi ko oda ko owu bibi lo. <verse eid="1CO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22" />Kwe Ala ba yimu sha Adole na yanya kpaha la? Ala bama byaha loshu sha Adole la?<verse eid="1CO 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23" />Awa kamo, &lt;&lt;Oshahata ko yojoji.&gt;&gt; Owokwokwoshi, oza kpiri pini ke woneshi lalo. &lt;&lt;Oshahata koyoza kpiri.&gt;&gt; Oza kpiri pini ke ya ya tahabo lalo. <verse eid="1CO 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24" />Ashishe kala naka tikpo koneshi kiyinu lo, ona ke tikpo koneshi kase ashishini.<verse eid="1CO 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25" />Ala hojoji ni yi ipishi kebe ni, gbo doka kojije lo shini otu wo naka kwuwepwo lo. <verse eid="1CO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26" />Okpa ko Owuso kamo, &lt;&lt;Ese kpoza kpiri kipu nu wa ka Adole la.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27" />Owoni aseni gyo Owuso lo ni pala ko ga roza ala ga, hojoji ni ayihoda dala kore ni, gbo doka kojije lo shini otu wo naka kwuwepwo lo. <verse eid="1CO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28" />Owoni ashe ke kamo, &lt;&lt;Oza rore mani ayipeka,&gt;&gt; ala ka re lo, ikweyi kase ni ka dala ni shini otu kala naka kwala epwo lo, <verse eid="1CO 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29" />olamoni, wela ni yipu kotu kala lalo, oke wa kotu kase ni kani la.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 10:29">Ashe doka mo, &lt;&lt;Owoni ole mani ojiya otu kashe ya wumobi ko yoza ni nyya yimu ko ya ni? <verse eid="1CO 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30" />Owoni nshotunehe do Owuso ikweyi koza ni nyya re ni, ojiya ni aba kwumepwo ikweyi koza ni nshotunehe do Owuso ni?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31" />Mani oni, oza kpiri ni oyaya, ko ya roza kwoya gwinyi ya kpiri ikweyi ki igyashi ko Owuso. <verse eid="1CO 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32" />Ka ya ashishe na shikawu lo, kase ko Oyahuda, kase ni wo Oyahuda lo, kase ni ba goda ko Owuso ni. <verse eid="1CO 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33" />Ala ya byoni nyya ni; nyya ya ela koneshi hin lalo, koni nyya takirikwu ikweyi ko neshi kase ashini, shini ana ngmawa.<verse eid="1CO 10:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1" />Ala gbami byoni ami ya gbo Okristi ni.<verse eid="1CO 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gboza Gbeyi ipu ko Geyagye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2" />Nyya shala iye ikweyi koni ipu kishi kpiri ala ba rela hin kpozafofu ni nfala ni.<verse eid="1CO 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3" />Nke ya yimu shini ala gye mo Okristi woteyi ko ongo, oba woteyi konya nu, kweyi Owuso wo teyi ko Okristi. <verse eid="1CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4" />Mani oni Ongo ni ya tinarigwu kwe ya tono kela ko Owuso kpikweyi gwogwu ebe ko geyagye ese ogbo Okristi owuru la. <verse eid="1CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5" />Mamani onya ni ya tinarigwu kwe ya tono ko Owuso kpikweyi gwogwa ebe ko geyagye ese ogbo obunu owuru; olema byo onya noweyi oni la. <verse eid="1CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6" />Owoni onya ya yikweyi nu gwu lo, ona yinyeyi wa; kweyi owoni owoza kiweyi donya ko yinyeyi wa, onya yikweyi gwu. <verse eid="1CO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7" />Oshoshi sho ongo na yikweyi nu gwu lo, ikweyi koni Owuso yo ongo lema byo oyi kpi igyashi ko Owuso; onya ke lema byi igyashi ka asuse; <verse eid="1CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8" />ikweyi koni ayo Ongo bwipu ko onya lalo, ayo onya ke bwipu ko ongo la; <verse eid="1CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9" />Owuso yo ongo donya lalo, oke yonya do ongo la. <verse eid="1CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10" />Ni olemani oni, ebe kayoleho, onya shu ko gbozagbeyi ikweyi nu oni ya sayi mobu nu gboshu ikweyi nu.<verse eid="1CO 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11" />Ipu ko yagye ka ebe ka Adole, onya na ka kamo ongo gboshu ikweyi nu lo, kwe ongo naka kamo onya gboshu ikweyi nu lo. <verse eid="1CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12" />Byoni ayo onya bwipu ko ongo ni, mamani onya pini mongo la; ojoji kpiri ke bwebe ko Owuso. <verse eid="1CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13" />Ala kepwo mani abiyikala; Oshoshi shini onya na tinarigwu do Owuso ipu kese kpikweyi gwogwa? <verse eid="1CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14" />Ipu ko yagye kaha oshoshi koni ongo ya shinyeyi nu bita na fu shoshu lo, owoza kiweyi, <verse eid="1CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15" />Inyeyi ikweyi konya ke wigyashi nu la. Inyeyi nwashika ni yikweyi konya ni ada nu ko le byo ozagbeyi la. <verse eid="1CO 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16" />Owoni ashe ya yimu ko tawashu ikweyi kela mani, oza ni ngbo koka ni yoma aha kwe oda ko bo Owuso ono kwe odu oyoye ko geyagye gwomani ta lo.<verse eid="1CO 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oza rore ka Adole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17" />Ipu ka akpaha pyopyi, nyya shiyala iye lo, ikweyi koni ogbayi kala ko geyagye ya yebe ishi sho oneshi. <verse eid="1CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18" />Ikyikyo, aka dami mo ala ba yiyikala kikpo ipu kogbayi kala; nggye mo owo kwokwoshi la. <verse eid="1CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19" />Ogbawashu lo owo tiri shini ala yiyikala kikpo shini awase ni ba yoneshi ni ana muwa neshi. <verse eid="1CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20" />Ishini ala gbayi ko odudu, oza rore ka Adole pini ala ba re lalo. <verse eid="1CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21" />Ishini ala ba re ni, ananoho takirikwu zakakanu ganu, ase shishini ba ngmemye, ase shishini gwinyi ba ya. <verse eid="1CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22" />Ala gbole kala ko re ki gwa lo? Kwe ala moda ko bo Owuso gyiyi lo kweyi tawase ni woleha ni iweyi la? Oji ni ala ba yimu mo naka dala ikweyi koza mani? Na shiyala iye? Aayi nyya gege lo!<verse eid="1CO 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23" />Ikweyi koni oza ni nfala ni bwebe ka Adole la nkamo: Adole Oyesu, otu ni ayora ni, ozi ikyoga, <verse eid="1CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24" />kweyi keshi ko Owuso, ofa, kamo, &lt;&lt;Omani wikpiye hin la, ni dala ni. Ala ya mani shini ala rela hin.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25" />Mamani, itikpi koza rore ko onose oki zabwa kweyi kamo, &lt;&lt;Abwa mani wokoyi pepe ipu koyi hin. Ishi kpiri ni ala ba gwa bwipu kabwa mani, ala ya mani shini ala rela hin.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26" />Omani ya sayi mo Kpiri kishi ni ala ba hi ikyoga mani kweyi ba gwa kpa abwa mani, ala ba tono ki ikwu ka Adole yoma gbishi ni oya wa.<verse eid="1CO 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27" />Mani oni oya shaha mo, kpiri kase ni hikyoga kwe gwabwa ka Adole owe ni gyogye lo, ogbepwo kikpiye kpoyi ka Adole. <verse eid="1CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28" />Ni ole mani, Ananoho na gyiyi nu ma ome ona hikyoga na ki gwa abwa mani. <verse eid="1CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29" />Ikweyi koni ase ni ha kyi gwa gbo gyela kikpiye ka Adole lo, okwiyiyinu epwo oma bwebe ko hoha kpo gwogwa. <verse eid="1CO 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30" />Ozani yase nwashika ipu kala ba gbere kweyi loshu lo, kweyi nwashika gekwu. <verse eid="1CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31" />Owoni abi kwobonu gyiyika ma la, epwo ko Owuso biya kwaha lo. <verse eid="1CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32" />Ishini Adole ke kwahepwo kweyi daha owe okyahatu, shini ahan ka gekwu kpese lo.<verse eid="1CO 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33" />Mani oni, ayene hin, ishini ala gbayi ko roza ko onose ka Adole, ala gbeyi kiyikala shini ala re gyogye. <verse eid="1CO 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34" />Owoni emye ya ngmashe, ona roza bwole, shini Owuso ka mobibi kala ishini ala gbayi dudu ni lo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 11:34">Ikweyi koza ashini, nwwa nyya wa gohobu ko fala.<verse eid="1CO 11:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12" />
  <para style="s">Eshi Bwebe ko Omaku ko Owuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1" />Anani, ikweyi kokpa ni ala ta dami ikweyi keshi ko Omaku ko Owuso ni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 12:1">Ayene hin, nyya yimu shini ala gyo kwokwoshi ikweyi wa. <verse eid="1CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2" />Ala gye mishi ni ala wa keka ni, ayala nyowe gebe kaweka ni gbo layi lo ni. <verse eid="1CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3" />Ni olemani nyya kada la kpiri kase ni gbo Omaku ko Owuso oya kamo, &lt;&lt;Igbe na to Oyesu lo,&gt;&gt; kweyi ashishe ya kamo, &lt;&lt;Oyesu wa Adole lo, owoni ogbo omaku ko Owuso lo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4" />Eshi ko Omaku ko Owuso baba gogo-gogo, Omaku ko Owuso ni ke ya dase ni woye kpokponu la. <verse eid="1CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5" />Owe baba gogo-gogo ko yoko, Adole oye kponu pini aba yoko danu la. <verse eid="1CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6" />Oshu yaba gogo-gogo ko yoko, Owuso oye kpokponu pini ke dase kpiri oshu ko yoko la.<verse eid="1CO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7" />Omaku ko Owuso sayi kiyi nu dananoho wa shini wo neshi ka kpiri. <verse eid="1CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8" />Ashe Omaku ko Owuso danu eshi koleho ko oziyi nwashika, ashe ke anano Omaku ko Owuso mani danu eshi koleho ko ogyogye nwashika. <verse eid="1CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9" />Omaku ko Owuso oye kponu mani dashe eshi kotuse, kweyi ashe Omaku ko Owuso oye kponu daneshi ko dase ogege. <verse eid="1CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10" />Ashe odanoshu koyoza kigbashi, akashe, odaneshi ko bane koleho ko Owuso; ashe odaneshi ko gya aweshi gogo-gogo ni wa bwebe ko Omaku ko Owuso ni kpo oni wa bwebe ko Owuso lo ni, ashe odanoshu ko kela igbenu gogo-gogo, kwikyikyeni ashe odanoshu ko gwikweyi koza ni oka ni. <verse eid="1CO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11" />Kpiri mani ke woko ko Omaku ko Owuso oye kponu la, kweyi odananoho byoni oyimu ko danu ni.<verse eid="1CO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikpiye Oye gbi Igo Nwashika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12" />Okristi lema byo ikpiye oye ni gbigo nwashika ni; otayoyo wikpiye oye kponu, koni ogbigo nwashika ni. <verse eid="1CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13" />Mamani, kpiri kaha, kase ko Oyahuda kawo wo Oyahuda lo, koshe kwe ase ni wo oshe lo ni, ayaha obatisma wipu kikpiye oye kponu kpo Omaku oye kponu, kweyi kpiri ka adaha Omaku oye gwa.<verse eid="1CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14" />Ikweyi koni ikpiye abiyinu gbigo oye kponu lalo, oke gbigo nwashika. <verse eid="1CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15" />Owoni ikpo na kamo, &lt;&lt;Ikweyi koni nwwabo lo ni, nyyipu kikpiye lo,&gt;&gt; oni ya yongma shigo kikpiye lo. <verse eid="1CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16" />Kweyi owoni akpaha kamo, &lt;&lt;Ikweyi koni nwwiyi lo ni, nyyipu kikpiye lo,&gt;&gt; oni ya yongma shigo kikpiye lo. <verse eid="1CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17" />Owoni ikpiye kpiri bi wiyi kin, abi ba pwaha kpoji? Owoni ikpiye kpiri bi wakpaha, abi ba pwipi kpoji? <verse eid="1CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18" />Byoni owe ni, Owuso yigo wonyonya kwikpiye, byoni oyimu shini ana we ni. <verse eid="1CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19" />Kpiri wa bi wigo oyekponu, ikpiye biya yaba lo! <verse eid="1CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20" />Byoni owe ni, agbigo nwashika, ikpiye ke woye kponu la.<verse eid="1CO 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21" />Mani oni, Iyi nye ko ka dabo mo, &lt;&lt;Nyya yoji kpawo?&gt;&gt; kwe Ikweyi ya gege ko kadi ikpo mo, &lt;&lt;Nyya yoji kpawo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22" />Abishi koni, awigo kikpiye ni ya bya gboshu lo, aba gege ko yojije lo owoni awigo ni loshu lo ni baba kpawa lo; <verse eid="1CO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23" />kweyi awigo ni aba ma byo agboko nwashika lo ni, aba dawa ishi she la; Kweyi awigo kikpiye ni shoshi ko moma lo ni awa pini aba dawabokpa la, <verse eid="1CO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24" />awigo kikpiye ni ke shoshi she ni wigo ikpiye ka ni aba dawishi lo. Owuso abwenu zabokpa digo kikpiye ni amamo owojije lo ni. <verse eid="1CO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25" />Ozani ya ni ikpiye woye kpokponu ni oma, awigo kikpiye kpiri gboko oye kponu kpiyiwa. <verse eid="1CO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26" />Owoni igo oye ya mowe, ashini kigo kpiri ba mowe kpanu dudu, kweyi owoni ashigo oye iye, igo wonyonya ya shotunehe kpanu.<verse eid="1CO 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27" />Kpiri kala wikpiye ko Okristi, kweyi ananoho kala wigo nu. <verse eid="1CO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28" />Kweyi ipu koda ko Owuso, Owuso yase kpiri baba: ikyikyo wayikoko ko Oyesu, omwepa wawobane, omweta wawofoza, omene awo yoza kigbashi, awo dase ogege, awotasabo, awoyoko koteyi, kpawokela igbenu gogo-gogo. <verse eid="1CO 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29" />Kpiri wa pini wayikoko ko Oyesu la? Kpiri wa pini wawobane la? Kpiri pini wawofoza? Kpiri wa pini gboshu ko yoza ki igbashi la? <verse eid="1CO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30" />Kpiri wa pini gbeshi ko dase ogege la? Kpiri wa pini gbeshi ko kela igbenu gogo-gogo la? Kpiri wa pini ba gege ko gwikweyi koza ni aka ni la? <verse eid="1CO 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31" />Mani oni, ala kpotu kala deshi ni she ni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 12:31">Oni shoshi she kpiri ni, wowe neshi owe ni shoshi she ni.<verse eid="1CO 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13" />
  <para style="s">Imu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1" />Nyya gege ko kela igbenu kasuse kpa kayoleho, kweyi owoni igbi imu lo, ela koka hin lebyo ogye kwa Amla ni ya ngmegba yeye ni la. <verse eid="1CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2" />Owoni ngbeshi ko nototu, kweyi gyoza teba kpogyogye kpiri; owoni ngbotuse ni ya gege ya shefu ga ni npa gbimu kase ashishini lo, nwwojije lo. <verse eid="1CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3" />Owoni nyyojoji ni ngbo ni yawoleha eshi, kweyi yikpiye hin dase ashini koyu ngmo shini na gwakya ikweyi ki kpiye hin, owoni nke gbi imu lo, nyya pya abola oyoye ebe ko Owuso lo.<verse eid="1CO 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4" />Imu wo omene kpo otushosha; Oya yanya kase kwe owo gwakya kwe owo zi ikweyi iso lo; <verse eid="1CO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5" />Imu gbotu bibi kwe ya yoza kiweyi kwe oya yimu kiyinu kwe oya yarisawu kobibi ni ayo ni lo. <verse eid="1CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6" />Imu ya shotunehe kpoza bibi lo, oke ya shotunehe kpo kwokwoshi. <verse eid="1CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7" />Imu ya kweyi lo; kweyi otuse, iyitagye, kpo omene ya kweyi lo.<verse eid="1CO 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8" />Imu ya wa kogbogbo. Onototu kela ko Owuso ya ba oke ya kweyi, eshi ko kela igbenu gogo-gogo yaba, oke ya kweyi; ebe ni ogyogye yanu ni, okyi ya kweyi. <verse eid="1CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9" />Koni ogyogye kaha gya lo, aki ba bane kela ko Owuso gyogya lo, <verse eid="1CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10" />Ishini oza ni gya ni wa, oza ni gya lo ni ya gebi.<verse eid="1CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11" />Ishini nwwoyi leke ni, nkela byo oyi leke, nyya rela byo oyi leke, nyya gbo byo oyi leke. Kweyi anani ni nke wanyakwase ni nshoza kayi leke bita itikpi. <verse eid="1CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12" />Oza ni aba ma anani lebyoyi koza ni bose kweyi lo ni aba ma ipu kiyimebe ni; ishi oni aba ma iyi kpiyi. Ozani ngye anani ngyo neshi lo; nke yawa gyo gyogye byoni Owuso gyun gyogye ni.<verse eid="1CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13" />Mani oni oza eta mani baba: otuse, iyitagye, kpi imu. Oni shuwa kpiri-kpiri ni wi imu la.<verse eid="1CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14" />
  <para style="s">Ela Ikweyi Keshi ko Omaku ko Owuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1" />Ni olemani oni, ala takirikwu ko gbi imu. Ala ki takirikwu shini ala pyeshi ko Omaku, otata weshi ko tono kela ko Owuso. <verse eid="1CO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2" />Awase ni ba kela igbenu gogo-gogo baka kpashishe lalo, aba kado Owuso la. Ikweyi koni ashishe ya gyikweyi koza ni awa baka ni lo. Awa ba kela teba Ko kwokwoshi kpo oshu ko Omaku ko Owuso. <verse eid="1CO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3" />Awase ni ke ba tono ko leho ko Owuso ba kela dasuse la ko tuwabo, ko tuwotugbagba ki kawotu agye. <verse eid="1CO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4" />Awase ni ba kela igbenu gogo-gogo ni ba tejeji kiyiwa abo la, ase ni ke ya tono ko Owuso ni ya tawogboso Owuso kpiri abo. <verse eid="1CO 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5" />Nbiya yimu mo kpiri kala ala kela igbenu gogo-gogo; nke ya yimu she owoni ala gbeshi kotono koleho ko Owuso. Ikweyi koni ase ni ya tono koleho ko Owuso oshase ni ya kela igbenu gogo-gogo ni. Ikweyi koni oza ni oya kani tawogboso Owuso abo lo, owoni agwikweyi koza ni oka ni lo.<verse eid="1CO 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6" />Anani nwwebe kala ayene hin, owoni nwwebe kala wa kela igbenu gogo-gogo ntalabo owe nya? Ntalabo owe oyoye lo, owoni nbyoza ni Owuso gwamiyi ma ni kwogyogye, kwoleho, kwozafofu la lo. <verse eid="1CO 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7" />Ole byo iyo koba ni gbolayi lo ba yeya, byamada kpo okuburu, ase ya yamoji ya gyoko kigye ni awo ni owoni ata kwe agwo gyogye lo? <verse eid="1CO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8" />Ase ni ya tegyi kefu kpokpo ni owoni ota gyogye lo, anoho ya pwo kweyi wiyinu shu ko gefu? <verse eid="1CO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9" />Mani oni, ase ya yamoji ya gyoza ni ala ba ka ni owoni ala kyoleho kpigbenu gogo-gogo ni agyikweyi nu lo? Ole byala ba kela owu la.<verse eid="1CO 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10" />Ose baba gogo-gogo ese mani, kwikyikyeni kpiri wa ke gba ase wa. <verse eid="1CO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11" />Owoni nke gyikweyi ko ose ni ase ya ka ni lo, awase ni bakela ni ba wogboga ebe hin kweyi ami ya wogboga ebewa. <verse eid="1CO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12" />Koni ala ba tikpo ko pyeshi ko Omaku ko Owuso, ni olemani oni ala takirikwu shini ala gye ipu ke eshi ni ya yoda ko Owuso ya gye ni.<verse eid="1CO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13" />Mani oni kpiri kase ni ya kela igbenu oye hoha, ona tinarigwu shini ona pyeshi ko gwikweyi koza ni oya ka ni. <verse eid="1CO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14" />Ikweyi koni owoni ntinarigwu ipu kigbenu ni ngye lo ni, omaku hin ya tinarigwu kokwokwoshi, otu hin ke yebe ni lo. <verse eid="1CO 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15" />Mani oni nyya yamoji, ome? Nyya tinarigwu kpo Omaku hin, nkyi ya tinarigwu kpotu hin mamani; nyya wigye kpo Omaku hin, nkyi ya wigye kpotu hin mamani.<verse eid="1CO 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16" />Owoni oya shotunehe do Owuso ipu ko omaku fufunu, ase ni gyikweyi nu lo yebe ko gbayi ni ya yamoji ya kamo, &lt;&lt;Nalemani,&gt;&gt; di inarigwu ko otunehe wo? Ikweyi koni ogyoza ni oya ka ni lo. <verse eid="1CO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17" />Koni inarigwu wo ko shotunehe do Owuso wo neshi, otashishe abo lo.<verse eid="1CO 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18" />Nshotunehe do Owuso ni nyya kela igbenu gogo-gogo shala kpiri ni. <verse eid="1CO 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19" />Ipu koda ko Owuso oya shoshi shini na kela oko eho ni ase gyikweyi nu ni, ko fase oza, shoni nyya kela okpaku okpaku ipu kigbenu oye ni ase gye lo ni.<verse eid="1CO 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20" />Ayene hin, otu kala naka lema byaka ayeke lo; ala le bya ayimeme owela kobibi, otu kala ke nawa kanyakwase. <verse eid="1CO 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21" />Ayitota ipu kokpa ko Owuso mo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">&lt;&lt;Adole kamo, bwebe kawase ni ba kela igbenu gogo-gogo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 14:21">Nyya ka dawase hin</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">Nyya kela dawase mani kpo okwunu kawo gboga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 14:21">Koni ole mani awase hin ke ba pwela hin lo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22" />Mani oni, eshi ko kela kpigbenu gogo-gogo wo oyi dawase ni gyo Owuso lo la, dawase ni gyo Owuso ni lalo; kweyi eshi ko nototu ko leho ko Owuso ya wakawase ni gyo Owuso ni, wawase ni gyo lo ni lalo. <verse eid="1CO 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23" />Mani oni, owoni awogboso Owuso kpiri gbayi kweyi ananoho ya kela igbenu gogo-gogo, kweyi awase ashishini ni gyikweyi nu lo ni kwe awase ni gyo Owuso lo ni wipu wa, aba mo ala ba nyoza lo? <verse eid="1CO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24" />Owoni ase kpiri ke batono koleho ko Owuso ishini awase ni gyo Owuso lo kwe ase ni gbogyogye lo wipu, aba sho ozalabi bita bwebe koza ni apwo ni lo. Ebeni awa bagye mo Owuso ya kwuwe epwo kpoza kpiri ni apwo ni. <verse eid="1CO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25" />Kweyi oza ni ayiteba otuwa ni ya tese, mani oni owa kwagye kweyi geyagye do Owuso, ya shagbotu kamo, &lt;&lt;Kokwokwoshi Owuso yipu kala ebe mani!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Igo ko Geyagye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26" />Ayene hin, oza ni ngbo ni yoma, Ishini ala gbayi ko geyagye, ashe ya wigye, ashe ya foza, ashe ya tono kela, ashe ya koza ni Owuso gwaniyi ma ni, ashe ya kela igbenu gogo-gogo kweyi ashe ya gwikweyi nu. Ojoji nala ba ya kpiri na woza ni ya toda ko Owuso abo ni. <verse eid="1CO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27" />Awo ni ashe kela igbenu gogo-gogo, ase epa kwe eta wotiri ko kela, ashe naka ome ashe na kyi ka, owotiri la shini ashe gogo na gwikweyi koza ni aba ka ni. <verse eid="1CO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28" />Owoni asheshe ke yaba ko gwikweyi nu lo anoni nasha ipu ko oda ko Owuso, naka kpiyi nu kpo Owuso<verse eid="1CO 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29" />Awase epa kwe eta ni wawobane kela ko Owuso na ka, kweyi ashishini wa na zakpaha neneshi shini ana pwoza ni aka ni. <verse eid="1CO 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30" />Owoni ase ke yagye ipu ko gbayi nyoleho bwebe ko Owuso, ase ni ya kela ikyikyo ni na hagye. <verse eid="1CO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31" />Ikweyi koni kpiri kala ba gege ko tono koleho ko Owuso, oyoye, shini ana fu na ki loshu ipu kotuse wa. <verse eid="1CO 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32" />Awase ni gbeshi ko tono ko leho ko Owuso na yiyi keshi nu, <verse eid="1CO 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33" />Ikweyi koni Owuso yayimu shan ya waya waya lo oke owo neshi kpo omene la.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 14:33">Byoni owe ipu koda ko Owuso kpiri ni,<verse eid="1CO 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34" />anya na yokwunu gwu ipu kogbayi oda ko Owuso. Ana dawishi ko kela lo; byoni ono kawo Oyahuda ka ni, shini ana ko woteyi lo kpiri-kpiri. <verse eid="1CO 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35" />Owoni aba yimu ko doka kela ikweyi koje, ana dawobu wa oka ole. Koni oya owoza kiweyi la owoni onya kela ipu koda ko Owuso.<verse eid="1CO 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36" />Kwe ala bama mo akwotu kela ko Owuso kpala la? Kwe ala fufu kala pini owebe kala la? <verse eid="1CO 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37" />Owoni ashe ya ma manu woyoleho ko owuso kwe ogbeshi ko Omaku ko Owuso, ona gye moza ni nyya ta dala mani wo ono ka Adole la. <verse eid="1CO 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38" />Owoni okpiyi kwomani lo, anu abiyinu ala nwanyi kpanu.<verse eid="1CO 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39" />Mani oni, ayene hin, ala yotu kala tagye ko tono koleho ko Owuso, kweyi ala ka wuwobi ko kela igbenu gogo-gogo lo. <verse eid="1CO 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40" />Owotiri koni ala ayojoji gyogye ipu ko owe neneshi.<verse eid="1CO 14:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15" />
  <para style="s">Onyiso Ikwu ko Okristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1" />Anani, ayene hin, nyya yimu ko rala, oshu neshi ni ntono dala ni, ni ala ze kweyi yo otuse kala loshu neshi. <verse eid="1CO 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2" />Oni wo oshu neshi, oleho ni ntono dala, oya ngmala. Owoni ala byo loshu neshi owoni ala byo loshu lo olema bya ala gbo otuse lo oma.<verse eid="1CO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3" />Nyya dala oza ni adami ni, oza ni shojoji ni: mo Okristi gekwu ikweyi kozalabi ka, byoni ayitota ipu ko Okpa ko Owuso ni; <verse eid="1CO 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4" />mo ayonyi, oshiyi bwamiri eno ko omweta, byoni ata ipu Okpa ko Owuso ni; <verse eid="1CO 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5" />mo obose do Obitrus kpo kpiri ka ayikoko igwepa. <verse eid="1CO 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6" />Itikpi koni, obose dase ni shogbogbo eho ni ba gboso ishi oye kponu, nwashika wa tayayo biyi, ashishini wa ke kwobonu gekwu wa. <verse eid="1CO 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7" />Ebeni obose do Oyakubu, ome obose dayikoko ko Oyesu kpiri. <verse eid="1CO 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8" />Ko gwejeji obose dami mamani, koni nle byase ni amo gyogye lo ni. <verse eid="1CO 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9" />Ikweyi koni ami pini nyonye ipu kayikoko ko Oyesu kpiri ngye koni aba yumogwu mo oyikoko ko Oyesu ni lo, ikweyi koni ngmawase ko Owuso ni. <verse eid="1CO 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10" />Eshi ko Owuso nke woza ni nwwe ni, kweyi eshi ni odami ni woyeye lo, oyun yoko sha ayikoko ko Oyesu ashini kpiri. Mani ke woyoya hin lalo, eshi ko Owuso pini yo oko kpami la.<verse eid="1CO 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11" />Ni olemani oni, Kowa bwebe hin kwe owa bwebe wa, oza ni kpiri kaha ba tono nu ni yoma, kweyi anu pini woza ni ala kyogwu kpanu ni la.<verse eid="1CO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Onyiso kaha Bwikwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12" />Owoni oleho kaha wo Okristi nyiso bwikwu, abo wonya ni ashishini kala ba kamo awase ni gekwu ni ba nyiso ipu ko olayi kelo? <verse eid="1CO 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13" />Owoni ela mani wo kwokwoshi, oya le byo Okristi nyiso lo mamani oma; <verse eid="1CO 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14" />Owoni Okristi nyiso bwi ikwu lo, aha gbojije ko tono lo kweyi ala gbojije ko kpotuse lo. <verse eid="1CO 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15" />Oni labi she ni, aha biba wawo kokame ikweyi ko Owuso, koni aha kamo Owuso pini yo Okristi nyiso bwikwu la, oke wokwokwoshi lo owoni okwu banyiso ipu ko olayi lo, mani oni oyo Okristi nyiso amiri lo. <verse eid="1CO 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16" />Owoni awase ni gekwu ni ba nyiso lo, Okristi nyiso lo mamani oma. <verse eid="1CO 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17" />Kweyi owoni Okristi nyiso lo, otuse kala woyeye ala tayayo bipu kozalabi kala oma. <verse eid="1CO 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18" />Kweyi oya shaha mo awase ni kpotuse ipu ko Okristi ni gekwu ni okweyi dawa oma. <verse eid="1CO 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19" />Owoni iyitagye ka ipu ko Okristi wikweyi koyiyi mani kin la, abi ba woza kiyinyinyi shananoho kpiri ese mani.<verse eid="1CO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20" />Kokwokwoshi ke Okristi nyiso bwikwu, anu wogwogwa kikyikyo kawase ni gekwu ni. <verse eid="1CO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21" />Ikweyi koni ikwu wa bwebe kase oye, onyiso kawase ni gekwu ni wa bwebe kase oye mamani. <verse eid="1CO 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22" />Ikweyi koni kpiri kase gekwu ipu ko dudu wa kpa Adomu, mamani kpiri kase ba nyiso ikwu ipu ko dudu wa kpo Okristi. <verse eid="1CO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23" />Ananoho ke ya nyiso ipu kishi nu: Okristi wogwogwa kikyikyo; ome ishini owa, awase ni wakakanu ni ba gboso. <verse eid="1CO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24" />Ebeni ese ya kweyi; Okristi ya yawomaku bibi ni ba kpase ogwu ni, kpawine ko oshu, kpawoshu kpiri kyigbo, ome oya yo Obula ya nabo do Owuso Ada.<verse eid="1CO 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25" />Ikweyi koni owo tiri koni Okristi oya yose gbishini Owuso ya yawo omonyekwotu nu gwagye kweyi yuwa sheye kikpo nu. <verse eid="1CO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26" />Omonyekwotu ko gwejeji ni oya yi gwagye ni wikwu. <verse eid="1CO 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27" />Ikweyi koni okpa ko Owuso kamo, &lt;&lt;Owuso yojoji sheye kikpo nu.&gt;&gt; Osayi neshi mo ojoji kpiri mani Owuso abiyinu yipu nu lo, anu ni yoshu kojoji do Okristi ni.<verse eid="1CO 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28" />Ishini oke yo Okristi woteyi kojoji ni, Oyi abiyinu ya yabo ko Owuso, ni yoza kpiri danu abo ni; kweyi Owuso ya kpogwu ko ojoji kpiri-kpiri.<verse eid="1CO 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29" />Anani, owoni onyiso bwi ikwu yaba lo, awase ni ayuwo obatisma okwunu kawase ni gekwu ni baya moji? Ojiya ni aba yase obatisma okwunu wa? <verse eid="1CO 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30" />Aha ke ojiya aha yika sho okwunu kikwu ipu kishi kpiri? <verse eid="1CO 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31" />Ayene hin, kurutu nyya gyiyi kpikwu! Nka mani ikweyi koni nyya gwabotu kpala, ipu ko Okristi Oyesu Adole kaha ni. <verse eid="1CO 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32" />Owoni, nkpefu kpo obekwu ipu kogya ke Efesu ikweyi koza ni ase baka ni, oji wa abola hin? Owoni awase ni gekwu ni ba nyiso ipu kolayi lo, byoni aka ni, &lt;&lt;Ahan re shan gwa, koni okyi aba gekwu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33" />Ala ka shashishe bita na gyala egya lo, &lt;&lt;Oya bibi ya pyase neshi wase bibi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34" />Ala shoza labi bita shala wa yoza neshi. Nkamani dala shala yiweyi ikweyi koni ashishini kala gyo Owuso lo ni.<verse eid="1CO 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikpiye ko Nyiso Ikwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35" />Ashe ya doka mo, &lt;&lt;Awase ni gekwu ni aba yuwa nyiso moji? Aba wa kpikpiye wonya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36" />Ikyo! Ishini otoza oya gekwu ome, oya bwu la. <verse eid="1CO 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37" />Ozani otu ni wedo ki izire shishi la, ikpo kewo kwe ikpo koza ashishini, ikpiye ni oya wa we ni pini otu lalo. <verse eid="1CO 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38" />Owuso ke ya di izire ikpiye byoni oyimu ni, edo ki izire wonyonya odanikpiye ni shanu ni. <verse eid="1CO 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39" />Ikpiye koza kpiri ni gbo olayi ni woye kponu lalo; Asuse gbedo kikpiye oye gogo, ebe kikyashi gbedo koye gogo, igbano gbedo koye gogo, kweyi ebinyi gbedo oye gogo.<verse eid="1CO 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40" />Ikpiye ki iso baba kweyi akese baba; oshoshi ni wa kikpiye ki iso gogo kpo oshoshi kikpiye kese; <verse eid="1CO 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41" />Eno gboshoshi nu, oya gboye gogo, awinyiwo gba akakawa gogo; kweyi oshoshi kinyiwo oye gogo kpa koye.<verse eid="1CO 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42" />Mamani pini oya we kponyiso wipu kolayi kawase ni gekwu ni la. Ishini ayikpiye ni nyi ogekwu, ishi ni Owuso yo nyiso bwikwu ase ni ya gekwu ke lo gbogbo-gbogbo <verse eid="1CO 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43" />Ipu ka amiri, olabi kyi sha; ishini Owuso yo nyiso, oya shoshi neshi kyiya loshu. <verse eid="1CO 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44" />Ishini ayinyi, oya wikpiye kiyi kpiyi, owoni onyiso, oya wikpiye ko Omaku.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 15:44">Okwokwoshi ikpiye kiyi kpiyi yaba, ikpiye ko Omaku yaba mamani. <verse eid="1CO 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45" />Mani oni Okpa ko Owuso kamo, &lt;&lt;Adomu ni wasuse kikyikyo ni, Owuso yo gbolayi.&gt;&gt; Adomu ko ogwejeji ke gbo omaku ni ya dase olayi ni. <verse eid="1CO 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46" />Olayi ko Omaku pini wa ikyikyo lalo, Olayi kiyi kpiyi pini wa ikyikyo la, ome omaku. <verse eid="1CO 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47" />Owuso ya Adomu kikyikyo, kpo omula ka agye; Adomu ko omwepa wa bwi iso. <verse eid="1CO 15:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48" />Ase ni wa kese ni lema byase ni ayo bwagye ni, kweyi ase ni wa ki iso ni lema byase ni bwi iso wa ni. <verse eid="1CO 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49" />Byoni aha alema byase ni Owuso ya bwagye ni, mamani akyi ba le byase ni bwi iso wa.<verse eid="1CO 15:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50" />Ayene hin, oza ni nyya ka dala ni yoma, oza ni aya ikpiye kpoyi ba rogwu ko Obula ko Owuso lo, kweyi oza ni wa ko gekwu ni, owoni ogekwu lalo oya rogwu ko Obula ko Owuso lo.<verse eid="1CO 15:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51" />Ala zakpaha pwo kwokwoshi ni teba ni: Kpiri ka pini ba gekwu lalo, kpiri ka keba shikpiye, <verse eid="1CO 15:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52" />ebebeni byo kyokye kiyi, ishini ategyi ko gwejeji yeya, awokwu ba nyiso, aba gekwu kelo, kweyi kpiri ka ba shikpiye. <verse eid="1CO 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53" />Ikweyi koni owotiri shini ikpiye ni ya wowa ni na shiyinu kponi ya wowa lo ni; koni oza ni ya gekwu ni ya shiyinu kpoza ni ya gekwu lo ni. <verse eid="1CO 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54" />Ishini oza mani gbodagye, ni ayikpiye ni ya wowa ni shiya kponi ya wowa lo ni, ebe ni oza ni Okpa ko Owuso ka ni ya gbodagye mo: &lt;&lt;Ayikwu ngmo; orore gyogya!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55" />&lt;&lt;Ikwu, orore wo yini?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 15:55">&lt;&lt;Ikwu, oshu wo yini?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 15:55" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56" />Ikwu pyoshu nu ko sase bwebe kozalabi, kweyi ozalabi pyoshu nu bwebe ko Ono. <verse eid="1CO 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57" />Aha ke shotunehe do Owuso ni yaha rogwa bwebe ka Adole kaha Oyesu Okristi ni!<verse eid="1CO 15:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58" />Mani oni, ayene hin moshi, ala hagye loshu. Ipu kishi kpiri ala ziyikala kpiri-kpiri doko ka Adole, ikweyi koni ala gye mo oko kala ipu ka Adole wo oyeye lalo.<verse eid="1CO 15:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16" />
  <para style="s">Ododa ko Dase ko Owuso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1" />Anani, ikweyi kokpa ni alata ko dikwiri ko tawa ase ko Owuso abo Oyahudiya. Ala yoza ni nka dawoda ko Owuso ni bo Ogaletiya mo ana ya ni. <verse eid="1CO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2" />Eno kikyikyo ko bize wonyonya ananoho kala na ngmikwiri bwipu koza ni opye ni tagye, shala kpotukpa, shini nwwa aba dikwiri kelo. <verse eid="1CO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3" />Ishini nwwa, nyya dawase ni ala shu ni okpa ni ya dawoshu ko byeshi kala go Ojerusele. <verse eid="1CO 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4" />Owoni oshoshi koni nyya ga ni, aba byumoshi aga.<verse eid="1CO 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ozani Obulus Gbo ko Ya ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5" />Ishini nggyehe Omasedoniya kweyi nyya webe kala, koni nyya bwa ko Omasedoniya la.<verse eid="1CO 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6" />Nyya wa yagye kpala kishi gbayayi, kweyi nyya yishi kowu mani ngmo ebe kala, shini ala tumabo ipu kiyawu hin, ebe ni nyya wa ga ohobwu ni. <verse eid="1CO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7" />Nyya yimu kowa mala anani kweyi shigbo kin lo; Nyya yiyitagye ko wa yagye kpala kishi gboji ome, owoni Adole kyogwu.<verse eid="1CO 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8" />Nyya yagye ebe mani ipu ko Efesu gbeno ko Opentekos ome, <verse eid="1CO 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9" />Koni owe koko nyaku oye gwa dami, koni awo omonyekwotu baba nwashika ni.<verse eid="1CO 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10" />Owoni Otimoti webe kala, ala yo omaba neshi na yoshi kojije ishini oyo kpala ni lo, ikweyi koni oya yoko ka Adole la, byoni nyya ya ni. <verse eid="1CO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11" />Ashishe naka monye lo, Ala ke byoshi ipu komene, shini ona kwikye webe hin; koni Nyyiyi tagye ko mo kpayene ni.<verse eid="1CO 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12" />Anani, ikweyi koyene ka Apolos. Nka danu kpoko nyaku mona webe kala kpayene ashini, oyimu ko ga anani lo oke ya wa ga ishini opyishi.<verse eid="1CO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ongmeyi Kela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13" />Ala gbera; ala hagye giri ipu kotuse, ala wawine kotugbagba; ala loshu. <verse eid="1CO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14" />Ala yojoji ipu ki imu yoya.<verse eid="1CO 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15" />Ala gyela ko Ostefanas kpi ipwoma nu; awa pini wa kikyikyo ko shagbotu ipu ka Akaya la, kweyi aziyiwa doko ko yoya da ase ko Owuso. Nyya bala ayene hin, <verse eid="1CO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16" />ala gboso ogwu kedo kawase mani, kpase kpiri ni ba yoko kpawa ni. <verse eid="1CO 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17" />Nshotunehe kpo wowa ko Ostefanas, Ofoshunetu kpo Akayikwu; ikweyi koni awa yoza ni ala bebeni ko ya lo ni. <verse eid="1CO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18" />Atumotugbagba, byoni atala otugbagba ni. Awase mani gye ko ni ahan dawabo-okpa.<verse eid="1CO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19" />Awoda ko Owuso ni bo okpagye ko Asiya ni mo na talogbogba; Akwila kpo Oprisila kpo oda ko Owuso ni ba gbayi olewa ni ba talogbogba kpoko nyaku. <verse eid="1CO 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20" />Ayene kpiri ni bebeni ba talogbogba. Ala tananoho ogbogba kyi kuwa botu kpimu.<verse eid="1CO 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21" />Ami, Obulus, togbogba mani kpabo hin:<verse eid="1CO 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ogbogba bwebe ko Obulus.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22" />Ase ni ya yimu ka Adole lo, igbe na to!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 16:22">Marana ta. Adole ka wa!<verse eid="1CO 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23" />Nyya beshi ka Adole Oyesu na yo kpala.<verse eid="1CO 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24" />Nyya yimu kala kpiri ipu ko Okristi Oyesu.<verse eid="1CO 16:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16" />
</usx>